  "authoringNote": "Snapshot only (D4). The case names f10x1-supplier-status as its supplier status evidence. Its only version is available and application/json, but its metadata contentHash is the SHA-256 of separately specified alternate bytes (the same body with effectiveTo 2026-06-29), not of the held body, so the record fails provenance validation and supplies no fact. The held body states an expired interval 2025-07-01 to 2026-06-30. Because it is unverified, those values produce no interval, disagreement or not-supplied condition and no citation; a version is supplied, so R01.supplier_record_not_supplied does not hold. R01 is manual_review for the administrative_reviewer with R01.supplier_record_failed_provenance naming f10x1-supplier-status v1, effect scope_hold (pack /rules/0/outcomes/1/conditions/0). Its C07 parent is [f10x1-supplier-status v1], since the held failed-provenance condition has the finding status. R01 cites only the order /item/code (1). R09 is conflict for the administrative_reviewer with R09.hash_mismatch naming the same version (needs_human_review), parent [f10x1-supplier-status v1]. State scope_hold, which outranks needs_human_review. R02 to R05 pass with the standard citation sets on the final order, encounter and receipt (6, 9, 6, 4). R06 is manual_review for the qualified_clinical_reviewer with R06.clinical_review (no refs, effect none) and cites the five /clinical/ statements of the usable encounter; R07 passes citing /lcmpReport/incorporated (false; the null evaluationDate is not cited); R08 passes; R10 is not_applicable with R10.pure_assessment. clinicalReviewRequired is true. Every other parent is empty; quarantine and superseded lists are empty, since no supersession is asserted. Recorded reading: a rule cites evidence-field facts only from the documents it reads, and R04 reads only final current usable records; every usable encounter and order here is final, so no draft is excluded. The standard chronology holds: the order date 2026-09-08 is after the 2026-08-24 encounter (not the same day, so C02 does not apply) and inside the C01 bound 2027-02-24, and the receipt at 2026-09-09T16:30:00Z is after the C06 span of the order date, which ends 2026-09-09T12:00Z. Deferred to S4: a later replacement supplier record and the reassessment it triggers are not exercised.",
